#: ../../catalog_model.md:31 29679eeae19d47609fab9b047483f609
msgid ""
"A unit has no direct link to its Model: it reaches it through its "
"Variation. The Model fields shown on a unit are lookups."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_model.md:34 cad423882a354e3d9fad8f1450a69119
msgid "What a Variation means"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_model.md:36 321ae23de97d461da97289a9a5ab80dc
msgid ""
"A Variation answers the question \"which version of this Model is this "
"unit?\". There are two cases:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_model.md:39 4aa44c534f39469e90df50f5ea949586
msgid ""
"**The Model comes in several versions** (`is_variant = Oui`). There is "
"one Variation per version, and each points to one Specification through "
"`Variant_name` (its `valeur` becomes `Variant_value`, e.g. `2 - 20`). "
"Example: *Finnpipette F1 | 2 - 20*, *Finnpipette F1 | 10 - 100*. The "
"Variation's `Name` gets ` | <value>` appended."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_model.md:44 58fbbd5781874376ae61ad550fa171fc
msgid ""
"**The Model has only one version** (`is_variant = Non`). There is still "
"exactly one Variation, a \"default\" one with no `Variant_name`, because "
"units can only attach to a Variation. It is created automatically with "
"the Model: `POST /internal/model/create` (the intranet's *Création de "
"modèle*) creates the Model, then its `is_variant = Non` Variation. The "
"receiving app's group push (`POST /internal/catalog/groups/push`) also "
"creates the Model with its Variation(s), as drafts (`Statut validation "
"Variation = À valider`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../catalog_model.md:52 834bd190d9464ccd9d5c822547f58a15
msgid ""
"The **condition is not a Variation.** `Etat esthétique` (Neuf, Neuf "
"déclassé, Très bon, Bon, Abimé, Très abimé) is stored on each unit, "
"because two items of the same version can be in different states."
msgstr ""

